Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 那女孩該不會有事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是先跟風紀委員聯絡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.16,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(438,436)}<Judgement>
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個都市 真的不會讓人感到無聊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總人口 230萬人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中學生人口實實在在佔了八成
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這座學園都市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡聚集了最尖端的科學技術
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,換言之 就是一座巨大的實驗都市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學園都市與其它地方所使用的技術 有二十到三十年的差距
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家在這裡學習的是～？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了讓家長放心把寶貝孩子送來這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.59,0:01:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學園都市已經設置了萬全的治安體制
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.83,0:01:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請放心...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.63,0:01:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 到底發生了什麼事...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.31,0:01:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紅綠燈...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 運氣太糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙到底是什麼人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是風紀委員
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:36.10,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(452,436)}<Judgement>
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.95,0:01:38.82,Default3,NTP,0,0,0,,痛痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,報案者所指的暴徒 就是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.22,0:01:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是白井黑子 已經抓住其中一名犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春 剩下的野蠻人都在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.39,0:01:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巷子盡頭左轉 5公尺後再左轉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.73,0:01:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.21,0:02:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是風紀委員
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接到報案後馬上前來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請乖乖束手就擒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.18,0:02:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我說多少遍你才能明白呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.31,0:04:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,維持學園都市的治安 是我們風紀委員的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你擅自出手 我們很困擾的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有在聽嗎 姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你們來之前 我都已經收拾完了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有權限的學生鬧事的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.69,0:04:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會被上級盯上的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.69,0:04:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你們就快點趕過來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說 學園都市實在對不起這個名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算整個都市佈滿了治安系統
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是沒能滅絕那種蠢貨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算歌頌什麼最尖端科學
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.43,0:04:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐...呃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幾乎跟我們的生活沒什麼關係啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:50.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人你啊 又在裙子底下穿這種煞風景的短褲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在看哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣穿 方便我行動 而且保暖...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自動售貨機 7116號
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確認到機能不正常
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有損壞公物的嫌疑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有損壞公物的嫌疑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能請你控制一下那些輕率的舉動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:16.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啦 不好 我們要趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.52,0:05:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？哦 今天是身體檢查日啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.52,0:05:22.03,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(487,436)}<System Scan>
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:44.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波浪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.31,0:05:46.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星星
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波浪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.27,0:05:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圓圈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.73,0:05:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個 38度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誤差0.2mm 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記錄 78m23cm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與指定位置的誤差為54cm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,綜合評價 Level 4
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:11.21,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(487,438)}<大能力者>
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 狀態還是普普通通啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:17.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然昨天風紀委員的工作還是造成了影響
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣來給自己找藉口的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都能看得到你的未來了 白井黑子同學
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚后光子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按這情況
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能達到Level 5的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:27.99,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(440,438)}<超能力者>
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該就是我先一步了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要將我與你的能力相提並論
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:39.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說 在三次元和十一次元 空間把握方法根本就不同...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說 我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本很不喜歡你區區一年級生就裝模作樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是老樣子 不聽別人說話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.75,0:06:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了 等本小姐做到常盤台的Ace之時...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.38,0:06:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 爆炸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:07:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 這學年才轉過來念二年級的你可能不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在在那個泳池接受能力測定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是常盤台的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:06.96,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(512,436)}<Ace>
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她擁有如果不用游泳池的水作為緩衝材料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.23,0:07:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就連測都測量不了的破壞力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有正面硬扛那一擊的覺悟嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記錄 砲彈初速度 秒速1030m
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連發能力 每分鐘8發
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中彈分布 18.9mm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,綜合評價 Level 5
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.85,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(487,438)}<超能力者>
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃？聲音甚至傳到了操場？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聲音太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都嚇到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 不用那種方法就測不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.73,0:08:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑子的能力比起我的方便多了 真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這只是你看好我 我看好你罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛 的確有可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 無論怎麼說 姐姐大人是常盤台的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:12.71,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(665,438)}<Ace>
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只管挺起胸膛做人就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王牌呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:17.30,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(400,438)}<Ace>
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛 不過
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要挺起胸膛 這「謙虛」的胸圍 還不足以自我主張
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊～ 但是這份謙虛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能說明姐姐大人的罪孽深重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面對這份 典雅而又挑逗的誘惑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑子我啊 黑子我的心兒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都快要壞掉了～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你從一開始就壞掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這只是普通的肌膚之親嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:09:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初～春～
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是淡粉色的水滴花紋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼突然掀我裙子啊 佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.52,0:09:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對同班同學用敬語 太見外了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:19.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 為了加深我們的友好關係 我再掀一次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真過分
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 我太起勁了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.81,0:09:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作為交換 要不要看我的內褲？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 話說回來 情況怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼怎樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還用問嗎 當然是身體檢查
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:39.16,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(530,436)}<System Scan>
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 完全沒戲唱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是老樣子 Level 1
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從小學那時開始 就一直停止成長了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.36,0:09:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班導師也跟我說「你腦袋上的花全都只是拿來看的嗎」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「用讓這花盛開的力量 在能力測定中前進！」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:10:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...雖然你班導師的說教當中可吐槽的地方很多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.33,0:10:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過嘛 打起精神來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說 有Level 1 不是還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我啊 可是Level 0
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.81,0:10:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無能力者哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過啊 我不在意這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要每天過得快樂 就OK了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.61,0:10:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 聽聽這個 打起精神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 這是？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我下載了先行播放的曲子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是收錄有這首歌的專輯的發售日哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.81,0:10:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都已經下載了 還要買CD嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,憑初回限定版的認購券 將抽中的百位顧客才有的Premium周邊拿到手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能算是他的真·粉絲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 我們一起去買吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我今天跟白井約好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說的白井 是那個風紀委員白井黑子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她說會實現我的願望 讓我見一見御坂學姐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在學園都市中僅有的七位Level 5
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.99,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(585,438)}<超能力者>
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常盤台的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那位御坂美琴學姐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常盤台的Level 5？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:06.56,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(470,438)}<超能力者>
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該不會又是那種仗著自己能力厲害 就用居高臨下目光看人的討厭傢伙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為那些人啊 不是都會把比自己弱的人當傻子耍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真讓人不爽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.53,0:11:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還是常盤台的大小姐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多美啊 大小姐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 應該是 正因為是大小姐 才美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這只是單純地憧憬那些名流人種的心理
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒...沒這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順帶一提 這也跟我出身於西葛西沒有關係
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 機會難得 佐天也一起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...我又不是很想見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.19,0:11:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題是...等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種機會 很難得的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等一下 初春
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:53.05,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(413,10)}{\bord0}#1 電擊使 {\1c&H4D81DF\fs20}<Electro Master>
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的粉絲？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在風紀委員第177支部
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擔任我的後援的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不斷求我 想見一見姐姐大人 哪怕那麼一次也好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道姐姐大人平常已經被粉絲們的無禮舉動煩透了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.02,0:12:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過初春是個懂分寸的乖乖女
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且最重要的 她是我認可的為數不多的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.37,0:12:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就看在我黑子的面子上見一見她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.86,0:12:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然 我會把姐姐大人的壓力控制在最低程度
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.45,0:12:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的預定行程 我已經做好準備了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「以初春為藉口 跟姐姐大人約會的計劃」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:40.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其一 在家庭餐廳加深友誼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其二 去女式內衣店(購入勝負內衣)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.10,0:12:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其三 去香料店購物(購入春藥)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其四 驅除初春
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其五 跟姐姐大人去酒店開房
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說 你要利用懂分寸的乖乖女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.25,0:12:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來實現自己的變態願望
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:58.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我光是看了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就已經積攢了不少壓力了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.87,0:13:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然她是黑子的朋友 就沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:18.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等 黑...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到你竟然這麼為我著想
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑子我已經 已經 不能自拔了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣會打擾到其他客人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以呢 我就來介紹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一位是 柵川中學一年級
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春飾利
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.59,0:13:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初...初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫初春飾利
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:50.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我是初春的同班同學 叫佐天淚子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道怎麼回事 總之就跟過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順帶一提 能力值是Level 0～
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐...佐天那是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.99,0:13:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春和佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫御坂美琴 請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請...請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 既然介紹已經順利完成
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然預定有些許亂了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的預定行程就由我黑子來...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.03,0:14:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 待在這種地方也沒什麼用呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如 我們先去遊戲中心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去...遊戲中心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 黑子我們走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.02,0:14:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不應該玩遊戲 看霸王書
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該多接觸點花啊 琴啊之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不能選些適合你身份的興趣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.31,0:14:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好煩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說 茶啊 琴啊那些東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡符合我的風格了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總覺得她啊 完全不像大小姐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也沒有居高臨下的目光呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.59,0:15:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:02.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是新開的可麗餅店
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,頭100位客人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送呱太吉祥物做禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這廉價的禮物算什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在哪裡還會有人被這種玩意引過去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,御坂學姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啦 你對可麗餅店有興趣？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是說 對一定要收集齊的禮物感興趣啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...你說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.47,0:15:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不會對呱太什麼的...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為那可是青蛙 兩棲類動物哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.71,0:15:35.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪個世界會有女孩子拿到那個還高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.95,0:15:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好多人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:53.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會有這麼多小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.21,0:15:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息時間為一小時
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要去太遠的地方哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來我們來的時機不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先去佔張長凳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天 我們的份就拜託你買了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚點付錢給你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.98,0:16:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...要跟我換一換順序嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實不用換什麼順序
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要買到可麗餅就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 呱太到手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給 請收下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是最後一個哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃？最後一個？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不介意的話 這個送你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行嗎 真的行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.21,0:16:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:02.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 姐姐大人 不用客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都說不要啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.87,0:17:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰會吃納豆跟生奶油做澆頂的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來嘛來嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.35,0:17:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,御坂學姐 雖然跟大小姐的印象有點出入
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是比想像中要更加平易近人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.95,0:17:21.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎樣呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:31.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚐味道吧 這是剛才的回禮 來一口吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.49,0:17:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人明明都有我了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟竟竟然跟佐天玩間接kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我大概跟不上這種朋友的步調...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.57,0:17:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那邊的銀行...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼大白天的還落著防盜閘呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春 你負責聯絡警備員和確認受傷人員
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:02.93,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(428,438)}<Antiskill>
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你抓緊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.85,0:18:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可不行 姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,維持學園都市的治安 是我們風紀委員的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.39,0:18:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次請你多注意點舉止呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現場是第七學區「相互接觸廣場」前的銀行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:19.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生強盜事件
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在申請讓警備員出動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 別拖拖拉拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得抓緊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.45,0:18:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是風紀委員
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.89,0:18:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是破壞公物 以及搶劫銀行的現行犯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要逮捕你們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這小鬼搞什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,風紀委員人手不夠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 小妹妹 不趕快到一邊涼快的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:52.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會受傷的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種人渣的台詞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是會豎起死亡flag的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.15,0:19:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.09,0:19:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就說不行啦 現在從廣場出去的話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有個男孩子不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他剛才說了句有東西掉在巴士上面就沒回來...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我跟初春...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白 我們分散去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.64,0:19:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今再後悔就太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發火能力者 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:35.23,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(378,436)}<Pyrokinesist>
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:36.37,Default3,NTP,0,0,0,,把你燒成碳...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想跑？沒這麼容易！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.21,0:19:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說誰...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.81,0:19:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.59,0:19:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想跑了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空間轉移能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:56.87,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(424,436)}<Teleporter>
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再繼續抵抗的話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一根我就直接空間轉移到你體內去囉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.05,0:20:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那邊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.11,0:20:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑到哪去了啊 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛好 跟我一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.56,0:20:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 大哥哥 你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.52,0:20:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少廢話 快來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.94,0:20:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也能幫上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然還是再去廣場找找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.41,0:20:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑子！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來就是我個人打架的時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.17,0:20:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我要出手了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想起來了 風紀委員裡有個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要被她抓住就完蛋 無論身心都會被蹂躪至再起不能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最恐怖的空間轉移能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是指誰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畜生 誰會乖乖撤啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還有個讓那空間轉移能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:08.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身心都成為俘虜的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.82,0:21:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最強的電擊使
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.82,0:21:10.95,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(470,436)}<Electro Master>
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用這個將你們這群混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一位 正是處於學園都市230萬人的頂點
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.20,0:21:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七位Level 5當中排第三的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.20,0:21:25.76,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(365,438)}<超能力者>
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.35,0:21:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超電磁砲 御坂美琴姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常盤台中學引以為傲的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.63,0:21:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最強無敵的電擊公主
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好強大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:16.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一般市民受傷者人數為零 還有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.29,0:22:18.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請...請你們快點走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的能力也挺強的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是Level 3吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:27.76,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(453,438)}<強能力者>
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:30.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為對自己的能力太過得意洋洋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.27,0:22:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會走上錯誤的道路了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你暫時再審視一下自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.19,0:22:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新做人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很感謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.82,0:22:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡 那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不知道該怎麼感謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 你也說幾句
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.42,0:22:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐姐 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.03,0:23:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立功了呢 佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.00,0:23:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.13,0:23:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很帥哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.21,0:23:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,御坂學姐也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.29,0:23:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人～
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.89,0:23:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.82,0:23:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天 受傷不嚴重吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.53,0:23:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.75,0:23:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:27.25,Default3,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.27,0:23:28.89,Default3,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.86,0:23:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,御坂學姐 也相當帥氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:30.26,Default3,NTP,0,0,0,,你給我適可而止吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.70,0:25:11.05,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\1c&H4D81DF\bord2\fs22}#2 烈日下工作 必須補充水分
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.17,0:25:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我憧憬的御坂學姐實在太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.25,0:25:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.24,0:25:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天 請不要往我頭上澆水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.27,0:25:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是花要枯掉了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.79,0:25:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說下周也會很熱的哦
